{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56875","headline":"锺陵郡民爲节度使纥干臮歌（题拟） · 佚名","name":"锺陵郡民爲节度使纥干臮歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自公之来，阖境讙咍。\n饮公之化，若乳婴孩。\n（见《文苑英华》卷八一○韦慤《重修滕王阁记》引）（按：记云大中执徐岁「故我雁门公按节廉问」。\n检《唐方镇年表》卷五，大中二年纥干臮镇江西。\n臮封雁门公。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}